{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1116159-looking-for-a-lgbt-friendly-geist-changeling-game","id":1116159,"title":"Looking for a LGBT Friendly Geist/ Changeling Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-14T16:56:51-07:00","id":1116159,"title":"Looking for a LGBT Friendly Geist/ Changeling Game","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hello, I am Ember16. I do not really have much more to say than that which is in the title. I am open to PbP, voice, et cetra (though I admit to being more comfortable with the text-based nature of the former.) I am also a MtF transgender person (I prefer she/her pronouns, but I understand if people mess up, I will not get mad.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And, well, that is about it\u2026 </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Thank you all for your time.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13217,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","user":"Ember16","date":". 07-14-2017, 10:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T17:18:53-07:00","id":1116164,"title":"","content":"I might suggest you wait for the new edition later this year. Not sure how many folks are playing Geist with a replacement on the horizon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T07:15:19-07:00","id":1116370,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I understand that, but still, I am hoping there will be enough to put a game together.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T08:24:34-07:00","id":1118570,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure how interested I'd be in Geist or Changeling specifically for the reason Lex mentioned, but a trans femme oriented gaming group is something I've been interested in putting together for a while. Feel free to shoot me a pm if you want to talk about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>she/her","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13652-manic-pixie-dreamcast","name":"Manic Pixie Dreamcast","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13652_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T05:38:33-07:00","id":1119469,"title":"","content":"I will be glad to find a PbP Geist chronicle as well. I'm also looking for a text based roleplay since I'm not english native and my english isn't very good...<br /> <br /> PS: I'm straight....^^;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","user":"Ipergigio","date":". 07-23-2017, 08:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T08:42:46-07:00","id":1119894,"title":"","content":"Hey there, <br /> <br /> My spouse and I run a play by post forum with Changeling: The Dreaming on it, if you're interested in C20. I'm a cisman and my spouse is queer, but we've had a couple trans players here and there. I realize CTD isn't the same as Changeling: The Lost, but I also realize how difficult it is to find safe spaces so I figured I'd offer. <br /> <br /> Take care, and I hope you find a good game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i43.photobucket.com/albums/e384/GrottyGilgamesh/3812c9a0-1510-4235-a3d4-1993f1a47b4b_zpsd6723580.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4266-mousegbn","name":"MouseGBN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4266_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T03:57:27-07:00","id":1126644,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if you're still checking this, but I'd be extremely interested in running an LGBTQIA friendly, text based Changeling: The Lost (1e) game.<br /> I've been working on a setting for that game for a while now but haven't found players for it yet. If you're still interested, feel free to send me a private message. ^_^<br /> I'm not really fond of the way some of the 2nd edition is written, so I'm not planning on making the transition when it comes out, although I'll probably incorporate some aspects of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":14178,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14178-crepuscular","user":"Crepuscular","date":". 08-09-2017, 07:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14178-crepuscular","name":"Crepuscular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T12:38:26-07:00","id":1136316,"title":"","content":"I would love to do a Changeling game. I would prefer in real time. in a group or 1on1. I dont know enough to run it, but I would love to play it. <br /> <br /> Anything come of this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}